  "goodToKnow": "Der Schlepper has several meanings: a tugboat, a tractor (regional, also der Traktor), and in migration news, a people smuggler who brings migrants across borders illegally for money: Schlepperbanden, die Schlepperei. Schleppen means to drag or haul: schwere Koffer schleppen, and abschleppen means to tow away, also slang for picking someone up. Plural: die Schlepper."
